From: Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>
Subject: tui: build on upstream opentui instead of the @mbears fork

@mbears/opentui-core 0.2.15 is a fork of opentui whose prebuilt
libopentui.so adds two native entry points; its source is not published,
so it cannot be built here. The TUI only uses API that upstream opentui
0.5.12 provides unchanged, and 0.5.12 runs on Node >= 26.4 through
node:ffi (--experimental-ffi) against the distribution's libopentui.

Patch-mainline: No

